<article class="env-example" id="08Y5">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/08Y5">Example <span data-tag="08Y5">47.5.4</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a domain with fraction field $K$. Then $R \subset K$ is an injective hull of $R$. Namely, by Example <a href="/tag/08XT" data-tag="08XT">47.3.6</a> we see that $K$ is an injective $R$-module and by Lemma <a href="/tag/08XM" data-tag="08XM">47.2.4</a> we see that $R \subset K$ is an essential extension. </p>
